Package: fpal
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libpam-runtime
Description: Fingerprint Auth for Linux
 A from-scratch userspace fingerprint driver, command line tool and PAM
 module for Match-on-Chip fingerprint sensors (currently EgisTec / LighTuning
 1c7a:0587). No libusb or libfprint is needed, and templates stored on the
 sensor are never deleted.
 .
 Installing the package does not change the PAM stack; see
 /usr/share/doc/fpal/usage.md.
